# Ques 5. Write a program to find the longest word from the txt file contents, assuming that the file will have only one longest word in it.
Code:

file = open("sample.txt", "r")
text = file.read()
file.close()
words = text.split()
longest = words[0]
for word in words:
    if len(word) > len(longest):
        longest = word
print("Longest word:", longest)

# Ques 6. Write a program to count the frequency of a user entered word in a txt file.
Code:

word = input("Enter word: ")
file = open("sample.txt", "r")
text = file.read()
file.close()
words = text.split()
count = words.count(word)
print("Frequency:", count)
